			"notes": "- LanguageManager now loads en_US translations as fallback\n- LanguageManager no longer clears the translations\n- LanguageManager now gets loaded on server\n- Added experimental TemplateManagedPacket\n- Fixed getBiome always returning HELL in the Nether\n- ItemWithRenderer re-implemented\n- Added parameterized EntityRendererTemplate\n- Fixed integer overflow in StationTessellatorImpl\n- Added conditional tags and tags removal\n- Introduced UnbakedModelLoadingFinishedEvent\n- Introduced BeforeModelLoaderInitEvent\n- Introduced ModelVariantMapOverrideEvent\n- Introduced RuntimeResourcesEvent\n- Added runClient and runServer methods to SideUtil\n- Moved Effect translation handling to the EntityEffectType\n- Added a directly accessible block field to AbstractBlockState and migrated usages of getBlock to it\n- Removed a relic Items class which was not used for anything\n- Optimized bounds checking in EmptyPaletteStorage\n- Added an index lookup to PackedIntegerArray to eliminate multiple seconds of runtime impact during a 60s profile run\n- Optimized PallettedContainer using direct field accesses\n- Throw an exception if an item does not exist in registry when loading a json crafting recipe\n- Mapped parameters in StationBlockPos\n- Added new overrides to StationBlockPos to make it consistent\n- Fixed AMI compat in dev\n- Added getParent, getParentId and getTextureMap, getTextures to JsonUnbakedModel\n- Added an ModelsUploadedEvent\n- Added a getSprite method to BakedQuad\n- Added pickModel, getTotalWeight, getModels and getDefaultModel to WeightedBakedModel\n- Added getModel to WeightedBakedModel.Entry\n- Metadata-dependent McRegion conversion rules\n- Fixed BiomeModificationEvent Not Firing On Dimension Change\n- Conventional tags followup\n\n## New Contributors\n* @GlacialSkyfarer made their first contribution in https://github.com/ModificationStation/StationAPI/pull/266\n* @ralf2oo2 made their first contribution in https://github.com/ModificationStation/StationAPI/pull/276\n* @Atilist made their first contribution in https://github.com/ModificationStation/StationAPI/pull/280\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/ModificationStation/StationAPI/compare/2.0.0-alpha.6.2...2.0.0-alpha.6.3"
		},
